*   (Linear Technology is now part of Analog Devices, Inc.)
* Lines below were checked character-for-character against the standard.dio
* shipped with LTspice 17.2.4 for macOS (2026-09-24) unless marked [ltwiki].
* [ltwiki] = taken from https://ltwiki.org/index.php?title=Standard.dio
*            (older LTspice release); NOT present in the LTspice 17.2.4 library.
* Redistributed as individual attributed lines for non-commercial university
* teaching/research only -- see NOTICE.md.
*
* Iave, Vpk, mfg, type are LTspice informational fields.
* ngspice: needs "set ngbehavior=lt|ltps|ltpsa" (the repo .spiceinit does this).
*   In native ngspice mode "mfg=OnSemi" is a FATAL error ("Undefined parameter").
*   In lt mode, mfg/type are dropped and Iave/Vpk print "unrecognized parameter
*   - ignored" warnings, which are harmless.
* ============================================================================

* --- small-signal switching ---
.model 1N914 D(Is=2.52n Rs=.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=.4 tt=20n Iave=200m Vpk=75 mfg=OnSemi type=silicon)
.model 1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=.4 tt=20n Iave=200m Vpk=75 mfg=OnSemi type=silicon)

* --- rectifier ---
.model 1N4007 D(Is=90p Rs=40m Cjo=30p N=1.4 TT=5u Iave=1 Vpk=1000 mfg=Diodes_Inc. type=silicon)

* --- Schottky ---
.model 1N5817 D(Is=31.7u Rs=.051 N=1.373 Cjo=190p M=.3 Eg=.69 Xti=2 Iave=1 Vpk=20 mfg=OnSemi type=Schottky)
.model 1N5818 D(Is=31.7u Rs=.051 N=1.373 Cjo=160p M=.38 Eg=.69 Xti=2 Iave=1 Vpk=30 mfg=OnSemi type=Schottky)
.model 1N5819 D(Is=31.7u Rs=.051 N=1.373 Cjo=110p M=.35 Eg=.69 Xti=2 Iave=1 Vpk=40 mfg=OnSemi type=Schottky)
.model BAT54 D(Is=.1u Rs=2.2 N=1 Cjo=12p M=.3 Eg=.69 Xti=2 Iave=300m Vpk=30 mfg=Vishay type=Schottky)

* --- Zener ---
.model 1N750 D(Is=.88f Rs=.25 Cjo=175p M=.55 nbv=1.7 bv=4.7 Vj=.75 Isr=1.86n Nr=2 Ibv=20.245m Ibvl=1.96m Nbvl=15 Tbv1=-21.3u Vpk=4.7 mfg=OnSemi type=Zener)
.model BZX84C12L D(Is=.6n Rs=.5 Cjo=150p nbv=5 bv=12 Ibv=1m Vpk=12 mfg=OnSemi type=Zener)

* --- LEDs ---
* QTLP690C = Fairchild red LED; NSPW500BS = Nichia white LED
.model QTLP690C D(Is=1e-22 Rs=6 N=1.5 Cjo=50p Xti=100 Iave=160m Vpk=5 mfg=Fairchild type=LED)
.model NSPW500BS D(Is=.27n Rs=5.65 N=6.79 Cjo=42p Xti=200 Iave=30m Vpk=5 mfg=Nichia type=LED)

* --- [ltwiki] entries, not in the LTspice 17.2.4 library ---
* LedWHITE is the older form of NSPW500BS above (without Xti=200).
.MODEL 1N34A D(IS=2.6u RS=6.5 N=1.6 CJO=0.8p EG=0.67 BV=25 IBV=0.003 Type=GePunctualContact)
.MODEL LedBLUE D (IS=93.2P RS=42M N=7.47 BV=5 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U Iave=40m Vpk=5 type=LED)
.model LedWHITE D(Is=0.27n Rs=5.65 N=6.79 Cjo=42p Iave=30m Vpk=5 type=LED)
